OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787064556
OL,3,CWater company admits supply failure is
OL,4,C'unacceptable'
OL,6,FSouth East Water has admitted that
OL,7,Frecurring supply problems are
OL,8,F"unacceptable" as around 8,000
OL,9,Fproperties across Kent continue to
OL,10,Fsuffer from low pressure or dry taps.
OL,12,FSpeaking to ITV Meridian, Mike
OL,13,FPickard, Incident Support Manager for
OL,14,FSouth East Water, acknowledged the
OL,15,Fgrowing public anger as surging
OL,16,Ftemperatures push demand past network
OL,17,Fcapacity.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
