OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787064556
OL,3,CWater company admits supply failure is
OL,4,C'unacceptable'
OL,6,FThe admissions come as frustrated
OL,7,Flocal residents and business owners,
OL,8,Fincluding pub landlords, say their
OL,9,Flivelihoods are on the line, with many
OL,10,Fwaking up each day not knowing if
OL,11,Fwater will come out of their taps.
OL,13,FThe recent disruptions follow previous
OL,14,Fsummer heatwave outages across Kent
OL,15,Fvillages like Benenden, Coxheath, and
OL,16,FWhitstable, where thousands were left
OL,17,Freliant on emergency supplies.
OL,19,FWATCH: South East Water's Mike Pickard
OL,20,Fapologises for "unacceptable" water
OL,21,Fsupply issues
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787064556
OL,3,CWater company admits supply failure is
OL,4,C'unacceptable'
OL,6,FAddressing the widespread disruptions,
OL,7,FMr Pickard said: "It's completely
OL,8,Funderstandable. We understand the
OL,9,Ffrustration. The relentless heatwave
OL,10,Fthat our customers had to go through
OL,11,Fand then coupled with the ongoing
OL,12,Fwater supply concerns that they've
OL,13,Fgot, it's unacceptable. And it's not a
OL,14,Fposition that we feel proud of."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787064556
OL,3,CWater company admits supply failure is
OL,4,C'unacceptable'
OL,6,FDespite staff working in challenging
OL,7,Fweather, Mr Pickard confirmed they
OL,8,Fcannot meet current customer demand:
OL,9,F"We have been hit over and over again,
OL,10,Funfortunately, with the increase in
OL,11,Fdemand, and our inability to meet that
OL,12,Fdemand."
OL,14,FWhen asked how long it will take to
OL,15,Fpermanently fix the infrastructure,
OL,16,FSouth East Water conceded there is no
OL,17,Fquick resolution.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787064556
OL,3,CWater company admits supply failure is
OL,4,C'unacceptable'
OL,6,F"I wish I could answer that, but it's
OL,7,Fa tough one to put a finger on exactly
OL,8,Fhow long it's going to take, because
OL,9,Fit is a big piece that we need to do,"
OL,10,FMr Pickard admitted. "We know our
OL,11,Finfrastructure is not where it needs
OL,12,Fto be. We know we've got ongoing
OL,13,Fstruggles."
OL,15,FWATCH: "We know our infrastructure is
OL,16,Fnot where it needs to be" - Mike
OL,17,FPickard, South East Water
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787064556
OL,3,CWater company admits supply failure is
OL,4,C'unacceptable'
OL,6,F"We've got a large investment program
OL,7,Fin place that's kicking off as we
OL,8,Fspeak, but these programs don't happen
OL,9,Fovernight... It's not going to be
OL,10,Fsomething that we'll be able to say in
OL,11,Ftwo or three, four months time it's
OL,12,Fgoing to be completed."
OL,14,FIn communities such as Benenden, local
OL,15,Ffrustration has turned to concern over
OL,16,Fthe sheer volume of single-use plastic
OL,17,Fbottles being delivered as temporary
OL,18,Frelief.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38407
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787064556
OL,3,CWater company admits supply failure is
OL,4,C'unacceptable'
OL,6,FWhen asked about the environmental
OL,7,Fimpact, Mr Pickard explained that
OL,8,Fbottled water remains the only viable
OL,9,Foption during severe shortages:
OL,10,F"Ultimately, the plan is to not need
OL,11,Fbottled water... Unfortunately,
OL,12,Fbottled water is the most convenient
OL,13,Fsolution to providing water. There is
OL,14,Fno other way as we currently know it."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787064556
OL,3,CWater company admits supply failure is
OL,4,C'unacceptable'
OL,6,F"The plastic situation is an area that
OL,7,Fwe need to look at how we can
OL,8,Fresolve... It's very complicated when
OL,9,Fyou start talking about plastic
OL,10,Fwaste," he added, noting that internal
OL,11,Fdiscussions are ongoing to improve
OL,12,Fhandling.
OL,14,FSouth East Water confirmed that
OL,15,Frecovery in hard-hit areas like
OL,16,FBenenden Grove will take time, with
OL,17,Freservoir levels relying heavily on
OL,18,Fcooler weather and potential rain to
OL,19,Flower overall demand.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,385,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F384A1787064556
OL,3,CWater company admits supply failure is
OL,4,C'unacceptable'
OL,6,FAs teams continue working to restore
OL,7,Fsupplies, the company urged the public
OL,8,Fto treat frontline staff with respect
OL,9,Ffollowing a rise in verbal hostility.
OL,11,F"All we'd like to ask is our customers
OL,12,Fto please use water wisely, but also
OL,13,Fbe kind," Mr Pickard urged.
OL,15,F"We've got teams out there that are
OL,16,Fworking relentlessly to try and get
OL,17,Fsupply back to our customers, and
OL,18,Funfortunately, we have seen an
OL,19,Fincrease in abuse towards our teams.
OL,20,FThey shouldn't share the brunt of
OL,21,Fwhat's going on."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G9/9
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
